 or other important information in the file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141997">file property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1824096">priodwedd ffeil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14661_132278_1824059"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web hosting and Internet service provider who manages the Web server hardware and software required to make a Web site available on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="132278">web presence provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1824059">darparwr presenoldeb ar y we</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14661_1508998_1824059"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web hosting and Internet service provider who manages the Web server hardware and software required to make a Web site available on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508998">WPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1824059">darparwr presenoldeb ar y we</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</ter