 line utility and an easily extensible infrastructure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="759889">DISM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2043221">Deployment Image Servicing and Management</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20927_760006_1166931"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A gadget that users can display on their desktop, rather than on the Windows Sidebar. Examples are clocks, news headlines, slide shows, and weather forecasts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="760006">desktop gadget</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1166931">teclyn bwrdd gwaith</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20928_760019_1166932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Automatic display adjustment that changes the brightness of your PC screen (laptop and desktop) using light environment information provided by the ambient light sensor.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="760019">adaptive brightness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1166932">disgleirdeb addasol</term><termNote type="