 message that applications must display when Xbox privacy and online settings prevent the sharing of video status.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991550">The Video and Music Status setting for [gamertag1, gamertag2, gamertag3, gamertags4] is set to allow apps to show titles of videos you watch in your Xbox Live online status.</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2914905">Mae'r gosodiad Statws Fideo a Cherddoriaeth ar gyfer [gamertag1, gamertag2, gamertag3, gamertags4] wedi'i osod i ganiatáu i apiau ddangos teitlau fideos rydych yn eu gwylio yn eich statws ar-lein Xbox Live.</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34441_1991551_2913765"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A message that applications must display if they will serve third-party advertising and cannot contractually guarantee that they will meet the Xbox Creative Acceptance Policy (CAP) for advertising content. The need for this disclaimer will be determined contractually prior to certification, and the inability to comply should be indicated during application submission. Talk to your Developer Account Manager for additional details.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991551">All content in this Application, including advertising content, is provided by [video service name].</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2913765">Darperir yr holl gynnwys yn yr Ap hwn, gan gynnwys deunyddiau hysbysebu, gan [enw'r gwasaeth fideo].</term><te