 all other elements. It is the top-level element of an XML document and must be the first element in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148023">root element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="509975">elfen dogfen</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4314_343665_509103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The element in an XML document that contains all other elements. It is the top-level element of an XML document and must be the first element in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="343665">document element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="509103">elfen wraidd</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4314_343665_509975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The element in an XML document that contains all other elements. It is the top-level element of an XML document and must be the first element in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="343665">document element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="509975">elfen dogfen</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</ter