phical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2866055">Microsoft 365 Multi-Geo</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2667142">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45210_2866055_2866203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows customers to store their users’ Office 365 data in specific Office 365 geographical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2866055">Microsoft 365 Multi-Geo</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2866203">Microsoft 365 Multi-Geo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45211_2579517_2582224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The readiness reporting feature that is used to scan devices and Office documents to determine their readiness to support the Click-to-Run version of Office.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579517">Readiness Toolkit for Office add-ins and VBA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2582224">Readiness Toolkit for Office add-ins and VBA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4523_146682_1824128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to run a presentation over the Web. The presentation is saved in HTML format and can contain audio and video. It can also be recorded and saved to be viewed later.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146682">presentation broadcast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1824128">darllediad cyflwyniad</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4525_5939_1095065"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol that improves the security of data communication by using a combination of data encryption, digital certificates, and public key cryptography. SSL enables authentication and increases data integrity and privacy over networks. SSL does not provide authorization or nonrepudiation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="5939">Secure Sockets Layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095065">Haen Socedi Diogel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4525_5939_1095095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol that improves the security of data communication by using a combination of data encryption, digital certificates, and public key cryptography. SSL enables authentication and increases data integrity and privacy over networks. SSL does not provide authorization or nonrepudiation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="5939">Secure Sockets Layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095095">SSL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4525_5940_1095065"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol that improves the security of data communication by using a combination of data encryption, digital certificates, and public key cryptography. SSL enables authentication and increases data integrity and privacy over networks. SSL does not provide authorization or nonrepudiation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="5940">SSL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095065">Haen Socedi Diogel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4525_5940_1095095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol that improves the security of data communication by using a combination of data encryption, digital certificates, and public key cryptography. SSL enables authentication and increases data integrity and privacy over networks. SSL does not provide authorization or nonrepudiation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="5940">SSL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095095">SSL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45253_2555759_2917503"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unit of measurement used in traditional tabletop role-playing games and role-playing video games to quantify a player character's progression through the game. Experience points are awarded for the completion of quests, overcoming obstacles and opponents, and for successful role-playing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555759">XP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2917503">XP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45256_2555925_2917424"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category in the Settings app where developers can configure their Xbox Live accounts in order to take advantage of the Xbox Live features and services.</descrip></desc