ion’s customized rules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2747247">call queue</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2750788">ciw galwadau</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48575_2747295_2750792"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables users to use a pinch gesture to zoom in and out of the Photos view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2747295">Super Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2750792">Pinsio i Nesáu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4859_295625_509636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A letter that serves to introduce accompanying documents to the recipient. Often refers to a letter sent with a resume when applying for a job.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="295625">cover letter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="509636">llythyr esboniadol</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber