sensitive information on disk and makes it inaccessible to attackers when the device is locked using encryption keys that are temporarily wiped from the device and only made available when the device is unlocked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864897">personal information encryption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2865960">amgryptio gwybodaeth bersonol</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50578_2864898_2865960"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that protects sensitive information on disk and makes it inaccessible to attackers when the device is locked using encryption keys that are temporarily wiped from the device and only made available when the device is unlocked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864898">Data Protection under Lock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2865960">amgryptio gwybodaeth bersonol</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50578_2864899_2865960"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that protects sensitive information on disk and makes it inaccessible to attackers when the device is locked using encryption keys that are temporarily wiped from the device and only made available when the device is unlocked.</d