elected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5072_138277_1945606"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a shared file, information that is maintained about changes made in past editing sessions. The information includes the name of the person who made each change, when the change was made, and what data was changed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138277">change history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1945606">hanes newidiadau</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5074_307449_1958916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A normalized value assigned to an email message that indicates, based on the characteristics of the message, the likelihood that the message is spam and that is persisted with the message when the message is sent to other Exchange servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307449">spam confidence level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1958916">lefel hyder sbam</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5074_307449_1985394"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A normalized value assigned to an email message that indicates, based on the characteristics of the message, the likel