ent organizational experiences and have enhanced control and management across the organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930025">Microsoft Teams Advanced Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930923">Rheolaeth Uwch Microsoft Teams</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52055_2930026_2930943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint experience with features exclusive to Microsoft Teams, in which users can see their notes, upcoming slides, audience member videos and chat, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930026">PowerPoint Live</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930943">PowerPoint Live</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52057_2930028_2930915"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability that makes it easy to plan and schedule quality, feature, and driver updates through powerful, cloud-based controls and leverages cloud capabilities to protect commercial customers from update-related issues through automatic pilot rings, ML-based issue detection, and tenant monitoring.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930028">deployment service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Nou