l</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="510023">Dyfeisiau Argraffu a Delweddu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8751_418607_1520201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To prevent another user from initiating a conversation and from viewing your presence or other information, such as your personal information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418607">block</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520201">rhwystro</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8757_558600_1930805"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The list of answers to a search request that match the search criteria specified by the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="558600">search results</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1930805">canlyniadau chwilio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8769_9149_1958622"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The part of an agreement that defines the business process that is used, your role, your partner's role, and the policies or parameters that are used in that relationship along with documentation, such as a list of business and legal terms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="9149">addendum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1958622">adendwm</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8776_370830_1095092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A listing or document selected as the best recommendation in the Site Directory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="370830">Spotlight Site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095092">Safle Gorau</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8777_24948_508249"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list in which each item or block of text is preceded by a bullet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="24948">bulleted list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="508249">rhestr bwledi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8780_100131_508807"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The temporary storage place on Windows where deleted files are transferred and remain until manually emptied and files are permanently deleted, which allows users to retrieve files until that point.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="100131">Recycle Bin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="508807">Bin Ailgylchu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8790_232417_509345"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of domain names and email addresses that you want to receive messages from. E-mail addresses in Contacts and in the Global Address Book are included in this list by default. People you sent messages to will be added to the list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232417">Safe Senders List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="cy-GB"><ntig><termGrp><term id="509345">Rhestr Anfonwyr Diogel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GBR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8792_359700_1798815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field size or data type that can hold positive integer numbers ranging from 0 to 255.</descrip></des